- Overall BOOT-1 remained partial: startup target failed, full Hermes removal was unproven, and startup/shutdown fault drills were not all run. Preserve this status even though commit `0834c3a6` was pushed to `origin/boot-1-int`. [Task 1][Task 2][Task 3]


